<title>USA: USDA fails to release weekly world cotton price.</title>
<headline>USDA fails to release weekly world cotton price.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Agriculture Department failed to issue its weekly world market price for upland cotton on Thursday as scheduled at 1700 EDT/2100 GMT.</p>
<p>Department officials could not be reached to say when the report would be released.</p>
